# AlterVPN – US North Bergen server profile
# ============================================================
# PLACEHOLDER – replace this file with the real .ovpn content
# from your OpenVPN server before deploying to production.
#
# The real profile should be exported from your VPN provider
# and must contain valid certificate/key material below.
# ============================================================
client
dev tun
proto udp
remote REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SERVER_HOSTNAME 1194
resolv-retry infinite
nobind
persist-key
persist-tun
auth-user-pass
verb 3
